  "description": "Non-Material Amendment to planning permission reference 220695 granted 09/02/2024 to alter the wording in the decision notice to allow commencement of the development under\r\nSection 56 of the Act, by undertaking a small element of demolition of the existing structures,\r\nnamely, the flue to the south side of the site. Continuing, alter the trigger for ‘pre-commencement’ on the relevant conditions\r\nto allow for demolition of the flue without needing these planning conditions to be discharged. The relevant conditions cover: Logistics Plan (4), Highways\r\nCondition Survey (6), Demolition method statement (13), Air Quality Dust Management (16),\r\nSource Protection Strategy (35), Archaeology WSI (44), Phasing Plan and Circular Economy\r\nStatement (49).",
